  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting international ethical standards, Recommendations and frameworks of AI and other frontier technologies in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Relevant institutions and other stakeholders, including young researchers and women, will be supported through capacity building activities, workshops, dialogues including research capacity, and promoting research-policy interface. Interventions foreseen through this workplan will contribute to fully upscale public knowledge and awareness of AI and other new technologies like neurotechnology which serves as tools for progress but whose consequences with respect to human rights, we are still struggling to grasp as well as youth-led mitigation on climate change adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
